.TH DEMAKE\-CHECK 1 "" "" "Check a project or .dmt: diagnostics, budgets, and the resolved plan"
.SH NAME
demake-check \- Check a project or .dmt: diagnostics, budgets, and the resolved plan
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdemake check\fR [\fIoptions\fR] [\fIinput\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check a project or .dmt: diagnostics, budgets, and the resolved plan.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-console\fR \fI<id>\fR
Check against one console; the default checks every target the project declares.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the resolved plan and every diagnostic as JSON.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
demake check ./pong
.br
every target, asset and artifact path
.PP
demake check ./pong \-\-json
.br
the same plan, machine\-readable
.PP
demake check pong.dmt \-c nes
.br
one console, one game
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBdemake\fR(1)
